REGULATED CONTEXT
Pathfinder records warehouse operations for a food-grade facility operating
under GMP. Movement records carry the initials of the identified operator and
are retained for six years. Altering, deleting or back-dating those records
defeats the purpose this software exists for.

PERSONAL DATA
The application stores, of each operator, no more than first name, surname,
initials and a salted hash of their PIN. It sends no telemetry and makes no
network request outside the local network.

